	(lib_symbols)
	(text "Columns COL1..10, VLED and GND are shared global nets inside the row/scanner sheets.\nRows and serial interfaces cross explicit sheet pins. RGB data is wired in order down the right edge.\nRow4 is the 9-key variant: COL6 is omitted for the 2U ENTER. Final DOUT is deliberately unused."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
